 "screenshot1.png", "id": "191426200727649", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974606_191426204060982_7564565095945023473_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JW6eE2QHsXIQ7kNvwHqV-dV&_nc_oc=AdlKFmNcyVsy8onrVMF_ldhxqkGPrP_8JKZpazaE2_ckIuahlVMUT55RDg9IQVoar4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx-kpdMy0f4meWjnm4gc0HMMgyHj3GewP8YHhm0BP3Zfw&oe=69AAC78F"}, {"file_name": "screenshot2.png", "id": "1095471491907793", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031510_1095471495241126_7904825382140520563_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KwzlBByS6c8Q7kNvwEaRk0i&_nc_oc=Adndy8yVe4dWlF7m_5-btXxhqapmIUZ7ePDQIPHHEGgI5t9fDOmS6LrlOGeDusZBWFE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyCjtVEf9ZCFmtKRdPtTUIsU40TF_pXZmpWqSyUFN8FiA&oe=69AAB93B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot3.png", "id": "1049137639698936", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982554_1049137646365602_1414254081213079555_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xlT6UQZa0k8Q7kNvwFBWpHP&_nc_oc=AdnSg6WQ56S65364alqJpA3CGQ8wS8CKgpyxg8Rmwrejrfl0u5UW8lQ6RG6h9C57IzE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwjeti60uxpgpQTMG0TQcDpXGLxnVRVCcjxelNob-oQCQ&oe=69AAAEFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "1535088327286928", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_1535088330620261_2696574789503898695_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cY5GXVdvn0EQ7kNvwE8c8ZQ&_nc_oc=AdmEhaNxZMDJdb1edMlGGhVl0J9xN1GCG2WWhG9lCLTKT994hiMVpAYhY-nt7pqPZC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxyv0hKtAW1ovRJ2ZmIhbYgn3neLle3NoT6RWgA28cPIQ&oe=69AADDDE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "7050636325025275", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031462_7050636331691941_4735315412487883710_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lEsp2yacjGMQ7kNvwEc4dLV&_nc_oc=Adm6fkDi6d8GjQSdL2BM7a1h-PCAlDYLs31l049vXOQnM4rONk49yAVQXhU1oLbIKCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy70W31BZLjCkqInJ_JO6scPQpczejrCUJEaH-xxRMd4g&oe=69AABC97"}, "display_name": "PlayMaker", "keywords": [], "long_description": "PlayMaker is an innovative VR sports app dedicated to soccer, transforming how teams strategize and collaborate. As a multiplayer platform, it allows users to create, visualize, and share tactical plays in a dynamic mixed-reality environment.\n\nKey Features:\n\nInteractive Strategy Creation: Design and manipulate soccer plays in 3D, offering in-depth tactical understanding.\n\nMixed Reality Meetups: Connect with friends or teammates in a virtual setting, ideal for discussing strategies or socializing.\n\nYouTube Integration: Analyze weekend matches in-app, facilitating group discussions and breakdowns of key game moments.\n\nMeta Avatar Customization: Personalize your meta avatar with team jerseys and accessories, enhancing engagement.\n\nReal-Time Collaboration: Work together in real-time, share ideas, and adjust tactics with teammates or coaches, irrespective of physical location.\n\nEnhanced Communication Tools: Utilize integrated voice chat and gesture recognition for natural, effortless team discussions.\n\nPlayMaker is more than just a tactical tool; it's a bridge between virtual and physical sports training, perfect for soccer teams and enthusiasts eager to leverage technology for an edge in their game.", "short_description": "PlayMaker is an innovative VR sports app dedicated to soccer, transforming how teams strategize and collaborate. As a multiplayer platform, it allows users to create, visualize, and share tactical plays in a dynamic mixed-reality environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://rezzil.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rezzil", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "htt